# RollRank project rules

- Read the repository-root `AGENTS.md` before modifying the RollRank application.
- Use `.cursor/skills/rollrank-development/SKILL.md` for feature, scoring, final, kiosk, PDF, Docker, and database work.
- Use tournament, racer, round, heat, and final in user-facing copy.
- Keep API, regular dashboard, kiosk, Final tab, and PDF result semantics aligned.
- Treat root `data/` as user data. Never delete or replace it unless explicitly authorized.
- Test inside Docker with a temporary `APP_DATA_DIR`; never test against the live database.
- Preserve the dependency-free Flask, SQLite, ReportLab, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript architecture unless a broader rewrite is requested.
